<section id="A7" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix G </span>Generation Hyperparameter</h2>

<div id="A7.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A7.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The hyperparameter configurations for text generation of both target models and draft models in our experiment can be seen in Tab. <a href="#A7.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ Appendix G Generation Hyperparameter ‣ TokenTiming: A Dynamic Alignment Method for Universal Speculative Decoding Model Pairs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A7.T6" class="ltx_table">
<table id="A7.T6.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="A7.T6.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T6.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt"><span id="A7.T6.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Model</span></td>
<td id="A7.T6.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt"><span id="A7.T6.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Temperature</span></td>
<td id="A7.T6.2.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt"><span id="A7.T6.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Top P</span></td>
<td id="A7.T6.2.1.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt"><span id="A7.T6.2.1.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Top K</span></td>
<td id="A7.T6.2.1.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt"><span id="A7.T6.2.1.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Repetition Penalty</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T6.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T6.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t">Llama-3.1-70B</td>
<td id="A7.T6.2.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">0.6</td>
<td id="A7.T6.2.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">0.9</td>
<td id="A7.T6.2.2.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">-</td>
<td id="A7.T6.2.2.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">-</td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T6.2.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T6.2.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Deepseek-R1-Distill-Llama-70B</td>
<td id="A7.T6.2.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">0.6</td>
<td id="A7.T6.2.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">0.95</td>
<td id="A7.T6.2.3.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">-</td>
<td id="A7.T6.2.3.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">-</td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T6.2.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T6.2.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Qwen3-32B</td>
<td id="A7.T6.2.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">0.6</td>
<td id="A7.T6.2.4.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">0.95</td>
<td id="A7.T6.2.4.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">20</td>
<td id="A7.T6.2.4.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">-</td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T6.2.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T6.2.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Qwen3-30B-A3B</td>
<td id="A7.T6.2.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">0.7</td>
<td id="A7.T6.2.5.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">0.8</td>
<td id="A7.T6.2.5.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">20</td>
<td id="A7.T6.2.5.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">-</td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T6.2.6" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T6.2.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Qwen3-0.6B</td>
<td id="A7.T6.2.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">0.6</td>
<td id="A7.T6.2.6.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">0.95</td>
<td id="A7.T6.2.6.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">20</td>
<td id="A7.T6.2.6.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">-</td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T6.2.7" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T6.2.7.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb">Qwen2.5-0.5B(-Instruct)</td>
<td id="A7.T6.2.7.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb">0.7</td>
<td id="A7.T6.2.7.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb">0.8</td>
<td id="A7.T6.2.7.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb">20</td>
<td id="A7.T6.2.7.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb">1.1</td></tr>
</table>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 6: </span>The text generation hyperparameter configurations for target models and draft models in the experiment</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="A8" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix H </span>Repetition-N</h2>

<div id="A8.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A8.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The repetition degree indicator is used to indirectly evaluate the diversity of the generated text. It calculates the ratio of the number of n-grams with a frequency higher than 1 in the generated text to the total number of n-grams.</p>
</div>
<figure id="alg5" class="ltx_float ltx_float_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg5.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 5</span> </span> N-gram Repetition Calculation</figcaption>
<div id="alg5.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="alg5.l0" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">0:</span>
            
            
           Text sequence <math id="alg5.l0.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>S</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S</annotation></semantics></math>, N-gram order <math id="alg5.l0.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N=3" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N=3</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg5.l0a" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">0:</span>
            
            
           Repetition rates <math id="alg5.l0a.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R=[r_{1},r_{2},\dots,r_{N}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>N</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R=[r_{1},r_{2},\dots,r_{N}]</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg5.l1" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">1:</span>
            
            
           Initialize frequency counters <math id="alg5.l1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="F_{1},F_{2},\dots,F_{N}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>N</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">F_{1},F_{2},\dots,F_{N}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg5.l2" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">2:</span>
            
            
           Initialize repetition rates <math id="alg5.l2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R=[0,0,\dots,0]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R=[0,0,\dots,0]</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg5.l3" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">3:</span>
            
            
           <span id="alg5.l3.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> each text <math id="alg5.l3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\in S" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\in S</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg5.l3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>



</div>
<div id="alg5.l4" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">4:</span>
            
            
            Tokenize <math id="alg5.l4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math> into word sequence <math id="alg5.l4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="W" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>W</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">W</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg5.l5" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">5:</span>
            
            
            <span id="alg5.l5.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> <math id="alg5.l5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n=1</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg5.l5.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">to</span> <math id="alg5.l5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg5.l5.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>



</div>
<div id="alg5.l6" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">6:</span>
            
            
             Extract all n-grams from <math id="alg5.l6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="W" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>W</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">W</annotation></semantics></math> of length <math id="alg5.l6.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>n</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg5.l7" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">7:</span>
            
            
             Update frequency counts in <math id="alg5.l7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="F_{n}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">F_{n}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg5.l8" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">8:</span>
            
            
            <span id="alg5.l8.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg5.l8.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span>
</div>
<div id="alg5.l9" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">9:</span>
            
            
           <span id="alg5.l9.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg5.l9.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span>
</div>
<div id="alg5.l10" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">10:</span>
            
            
           <span id="alg5.l10.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> <math id="alg5.l10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n=1</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg5.l10.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">to</span> <math id="alg5.l10.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg5.l10.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>



</div>
<div id="alg5.l11" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">11:</span>
            
            
            Count repeated n-grams: <math id="alg5.l11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C_{rep}=|\{f\in F_{n}:f&gt;1\}|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C_{rep}=|\{f\in F_{n}:f&gt;1\}|</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg5.l12" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">12:</span>
            
            
            Count total unique n-grams: <math id="alg5.l12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C_{total}=|F_{n}|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C_{total}=|F_{n}|</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg5.l13" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">13:</span>
            
            
            <math id="alg5.l13.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r_{n}=C_{rep}/C_{total}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo>/</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r_{n}=C_{rep}/C_{total}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg5.l14" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">14:</span>
            
            
           <span id="alg5.l14.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg5.l14.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span>
</div>
<div id="alg5.l15" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">15:</span>
            
            
           
</div>
<div id="alg5.l16" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">16:</span>
            
            
           <span id="alg5.l16.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">return</span>  <math id="alg5.l16.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R\times 100" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R\times 100</annotation></semantics></math> {Convert to percentages}

</div>
</div>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="A9" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix I </span>Token Distance</h2>

<div id="A9.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A9.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The Edit Distance, often referred to as Levenshtein Distance, is a measure of the similarity between two strings (tokens). It is defined as the minimum number of single-character edits (insertions, deletions, or substitutions) required to change one token into the other.</p>
</div>
<section id="A9.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">I.1 </span>1. Symbol Definition</h3>

<div id="A9.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A9.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Let the source token be denoted by <math id="A9.SS1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>s</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s</annotation></semantics></math> of length <math id="A9.SS1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>m</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m</annotation></semantics></math>, and the target token be denoted by <math id="A9.SS1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math> of length <math id="A9.SS1.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>n</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
<ul id="A9.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A9.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A9.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A9.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Source token: <math id="A9.I1.i1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s=s_{1}s_{2}...s_{m}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s=s_{1}s_{2}...s_{m}</annotation></semantics></math></p>
</div></li>
<li id="A9.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A9.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A9.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Target token: <math id="A9.I1.i2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t=t_{1}t_{2}...t_{n}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t=t_{1}t_{2}...t_{n}</annotation></semantics></math></p>
</div></li>
</ul>
<p id="A9.SS1.p1.2" class="ltx_p">The edit distance between the first <math id="A9.SS1.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>i</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i</annotation></semantics></math> characters of <math id="A9.SS1.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>s</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s</annotation></semantics></math> and the first <math id="A9.SS1.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="j" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>j</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">j</annotation></semantics></math> characters of <math id="A9.SS1.p1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math> is denoted by <math id="A9.SS1.p1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="D(i,j)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D(i,j)</annotation></semantics></math>. The goal is to compute <math id="A9.SS1.p1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="D(m,n)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D(m,n)</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
<div id="A9.SS1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A9.SS1.p2.1" class="ltx_p">The cost of a substitution operation is defined as:</p>
<table id="A9.Ex26" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A9.Ex26.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\text{cost}_{sub}(s_{i},t_{j})=\begin{cases}0&amp;\text{if }s_{i}=t_{j}\\
1&amp;\text{if }s_{i}\neq t_{j}\end{cases}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mtext>cost</mtext><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mtable columnspacing="5pt" displaystyle="true" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mtext>if </mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mtext>if </mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo>≠</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{cost}_{sub}(s_{i},t_{j})=\begin{cases}0&amp;\text{if }s_{i}=t_{j}\\
1&amp;\text{if }s_{i}\neq t_{j}\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A9.SS1.p2.2" class="ltx_p">The cost for a deletion or an insertion is always 1.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A9.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">I.2 </span>2. Calculation Process</h3>

<div id="A9.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A9.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We use a dynamic programming approach to compute the distance. A matrix <math id="A9.SS2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="D" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>D</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D</annotation></semantics></math> of size <math id="A9.SS2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(m+1)\times(n+1)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(m+1)\times(n+1)</annotation></semantics></math> is constructed.</p>
</div>
<section id="A9.SS2.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Step 1: Initialization</h5>

<div id="A9.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A9.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The first row and the first column of the matrix are initialized to represent the edits needed to transform a prefix into an empty string, or an empty string into a prefix.</p>
<table id="A9.EGx8" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A9.Ex27"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A9.Ex27.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle D(i,0)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle D(i,0)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A9.Ex27.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle=i\quad\text{for }i=0,\dots,m" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>i</mi><mtext>for </mtext><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=i\quad\text{for }i=0,\dots,m</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A9.Ex28"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A9.Ex28.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle D(0,j)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle D(0,j)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A9.Ex28.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle=j\quad\text{for }j=0,\dots,n" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>j</mi><mtext>for </mtext><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=j\quad\text{for }j=0,\dots,n</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A9.SS2.SSS0.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Step 2: Recurrence Relation</h5>

<div id="A9.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A9.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">For every <math id="A9.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>i</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i</annotation></semantics></math> from 1 to <math id="A9.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>m</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m</annotation></semantics></math> and every <math id="A9.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="j" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>j</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">j</annotation></semantics></math> from 1 to <math id="A9.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>n</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n</annotation></semantics></math>, the value of <math id="A9.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="D(i,j)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D(i,j)</annotation></semantics></math> is calculated as the minimum of three possible operations:</p>
<ol id="A9.I2" class="ltx_enumerate">
<li id="A9.I2.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">1.</span> 
<div id="A9.I2.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A9.I2.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A9.I2.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Deletion:</span> Deleting character <math id="A9.I2.i1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>. The cost is <math id="A9.I2.i1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="D(i-1,j)+1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D(i-1,j)+1</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A9.I2.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">2.</span> 
<div id="A9.I2.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A9.I2.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A9.I2.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Insertion:</span> Inserting character <math id="A9.I2.i2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t_{j}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t_{j}</annotation></semantics></math>. The cost is <math id="A9.I2.i2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="D(i,j-1)+1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D(i,j-1)+1</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A9.I2.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">3.</span> 
<div id="A9.I2.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A9.I2.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A9.I2.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Substitution:</span> Replacing <math id="A9.I2.i3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> with <math id="A9.I2.i3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t_{j}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t_{j}</annotation></semantics></math>. The cost is <math id="A9.I2.i3.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="D(i-1,j-1)+\text{cost}_{sub}(s_{i},t_{j})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mtext>cost</mtext><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D(i-1,j-1)+\text{cost}_{sub}(s_{i},t_{j})</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div></li>
</ol>
</div>
<div id="A9.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A9.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p2.1" class="ltx_p">This gives the recurrence relation:</p>
<table id="A9.Ex29" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A9.Ex29.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="D(i,j)=\min\begin{cases}D(i-1,j)+1\quad\text{(deletion)}\\
D(i,j-1)+1\quad\text{(insertion)}\\
D(i-1,j-1)+\text{cost}_{sub}(s_{i},t_{j})&amp;\\
\text{(substitution)}\end{cases}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mtable columnspacing="5pt" displaystyle="true" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mspace style="width:1em;" width="1em"></mspace><mtext>(deletion)</mtext></mrow></mtd><mtd></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mspace style="width:1em;" width="1em"></mspace><mtext>(insertion)</mtext></mrow></mtd><mtd></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mtext>cost</mtext><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mtd><mtd></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mtext>(substitution)</mtext></mtd><mtd></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D(i,j)=\min\begin{cases}D(i-1,j)+1\quad\text{(deletion)}\\
D(i,j-1)+1\quad\text{(insertion)}\\
D(i-1,j-1)+\text{cost}_{sub}(s_{i},t_{j})&amp;\\
\text{(substitution)}\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A9.SS2.SSS0.Px3" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Step 3: Final Result</h5>

<div id="A9.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A9.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The edit distance between the entire token <math id="A9.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>s</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s</annotation></semantics></math> and token <math id="A9.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math> is the value in the last cell of the matrix:</p>
<table id="A9.Ex30" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A9.Ex30.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\text{distance}(s,t)=D(m,n)" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mtext>distance</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{distance}(s,t)=D(m,n)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</section>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A10" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix J </span>Special Tokens</h2>

<figure id="A10.T7" class="ltx_table">
<table id="A10.T7.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="A10.T7.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A10.T7.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t"><span id="A10.T7.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Tokenizer</span></td>
<td id="A10.T7.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_r ltx_border_t"><span id="A10.T7.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Special Token</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A10.T7.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A10.T7.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">LlamaTokenizer</td>
<td id="A10.T7.2.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">’ ’</td></tr>
<tr id="A10.T7.2.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A10.T7.2.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">PreTrainedTokenizerFast</td>
<td id="A10.T7.2.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">’Ġ’</td></tr>
<tr id="A10.T7.2.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A10.T7.2.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">GPTNeoXTokenizerFast</td>
<td id="A10.T7.2.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">’Ġ’</td></tr>
<tr id="A10.T7.2.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A10.T7.2.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">CodeGenTokenizer</td>
<td id="A10.T7.2.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">’Ġ’</td></tr>
<tr id="A10.T7.2.6" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A10.T7.2.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">GPT2Tokenizer</td>
<td id="A10.T7.2.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">’Ġ’</td></tr>
<tr id="A10.T7.2.7" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A10.T7.2.7.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">GemmaTokenizer</td>
<td id="A10.T7.2.7.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">’Ġ’</td></tr>
<tr id="A10.T7.2.8" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A10.T7.2.8.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_b ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">Qwen2Tokenizer</td>
<td id="A10.T7.2.8.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_b ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">’Ġ’</td></tr>
</table>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 7: </span>Special Tokens in Common Tokenizers</figcaption>
</figure>
<div id="A10.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A10.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The vocabularies of Large Language Models include numerous special tokens that serve functional roles rather than representing natural language. Examples include the ‘Ġ‘ (U+0120), which signifies the beginning of a word, or meta-tokens such as <math id="A10.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="&lt;" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>&lt;</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">&lt;</annotation></semantics></math>think<math id="A10.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="&gt;" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>&gt;</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">&gt;</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A10.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="&lt;" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>&lt;</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">&lt;</annotation></semantics></math>EOS<math id="A10.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="&gt;" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>&gt;</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">&gt;</annotation></semantics></math> that direct the model’s generation process. The presence of these tokens can potentially impact alignment quality. For instance, a mismatch in the placement of a ‘Ġ‘ token between the draft and target sequences could cause a misalignment of an entire sentence. During the DTW matching process, we removed the special tokens or shortened the prefixes that appeared frequently as shown in Appendix <a href="#A10.T7" title="Table 7 ‣ Appendix J Special Tokens ‣ TokenTiming: A Dynamic Alignment Method for Universal Speculative Decoding Model Pairs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a> to ensure the correctness of the matching. In the future, further optimization will involve incorporating more special Tokens into the preprocessing scope.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A11" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix K </span>Model Vocabulary Statistics</h2>

<figure id="A11.T8" class="ltx_table">
<table id="A11.T8.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="A11.T8.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A11.T8.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tttt" style="padding:-1pt 3.0pt;"><span id="A11.T8.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Model Name</span></td>
<td id="A11.T8.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tttt" style="padding:-1pt 3.0pt;"><span id="A11.T8.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Vocabulary Size (tokens)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A11.T8.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A11.T8.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" style="padding:-1pt 3.0pt;">DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-70B</td>
<td id="A11.T8.2.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" style="padding:-1pt 3.0pt;"><math id="A11.T8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="128,256" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>128</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>256</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">128,256</annotation></semantics></math></td></tr>
<tr id="A11.T8.2.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A11.T8.2.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding:-1pt 3.0pt;">Meta-Llama-3.1-70B</td>
<td id="A11.T8.2.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding:-1pt 3.0pt;"><math id="A11.T8.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="128,256" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>128</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>256</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">128,256</annotation></semantics></math></td></tr>
<tr id="A11.T8.2.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A11.T8.2.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding:-1pt 3.0pt;">phi-4</td>
<td id="A11.T8.2.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding:-1pt 3.0pt;"><math id="A11.T8.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="100,352" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>352</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">100,352</annotation></semantics></math></td></tr>
<tr id="A11.T8.2.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A11.T8.2.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding:-1pt 3.0pt;">Qwen3-30B-A3B</td>
<td id="A11.T8.2.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding:-1pt 3.0pt;"><math id="A11.T8.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="151,669" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>151</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>669</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">151,669</annotation></semantics></math></td></tr>
<tr id="A11.T8.2.6" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A11.T8.2.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding:-1pt 3.0pt;">Qwen3-32B</td>
<td id="A11.T8.2.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding:-1pt 3.0pt;"><math id="A11.T8.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="151,669" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>151</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>669</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">151,669</annotation></semantics></math></td></tr>
